questions.question:
A + B means ‘A is the husband of B’;

A – B means ‘B is the sister of A’;

A × B means ‘A is the mother of B’;

A ÷ B means ‘B is the son of A’.

If P + R × T – Q ÷ S + U, then how is P related to S?

questions.solution:
